        "text": "=Extract a structured support issue from this message.\n\nReturn only valid JSON:\n\n{\n  \"summary\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"customer\": \"\",\n  \"module\": \"\",\n  \"severity\": \"\",\n  \"reference_ids\": []\n}\n\nRules:\n- Do not invent information.\n- customer: only if explicitly present.\n- module: infer only if reasonably clear.\n- severity: Critical, High, Medium, Low based on stated impact.\n- reference_ids: trip, DO, ticket, order or transaction IDs mentioned.\n\nMessage:\n{{ $('JIRA Exists?').item.json.text }}",
